          "guid": "msy4fvh7kj2d2538",
          "message": {
            "text": "Blink computes initial-letter size from the selected face's vertical metrics (style_resolver.cc::ComputeInitialLetterFont). Capture records Chromium's resulting floated-cap ink height, but the browser canvas probe and Domotion's resolved SFNT can expose different metrics. Refit to that recorded height using the exact face selected by the renderer; width is deliberately not fitted because it is an output of Blink's height-driven sizing rule.",
            "markdown": "Blink computes initial-letter size from the selected face's vertical metrics (`style_resolver.cc::ComputeInitialLetterFont`). Capture records Chromium's resulting floated-cap ink height, but the browser canvas probe and Domotion's resolved SFNT can expose different metrics. Refit to that recorded height using the exact face selected by the renderer; width is deliberately not fitted because it is an output of Blink's height-driven sizing rule."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/render/text.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 1900,
                  "endLine": 1908,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "    // purple-bold, the abbr[title]::after blue-and-smaller, etc. ::first-line\n    // uses the same mechanism — the first segment of a paragraph inherits a\n    // pseudo-style override from CAPTURE_SCRIPT (DM-294).\n    const segColor = seg.color ?? fillColor;\n    let segFontSize = seg.fontSize ?? elFontSize;\n    const segFontWeight = seg.fontWeight ?? elFontWeight;\n    const segFontStyle = seg.fontStyle ?? el.styles.fontStyle;\n    // DM-513: pseudos with `font-family: 'sdicon'` etc. need their icon font\n    // routed through the renderer, not the parent element's body font."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
